  "description": "Lee Ji-han, a young Korean-American, on a plane to volunteer abroad to write on his resume.  \nHowever, he accidentally falls into the Amazon jungle and is captured by the Marua tribe.  \nSince then, Jian hears from the guide Hyung-min, who is belatedly caught after being caressed by the Marua chief Janadum without knowing English every day,  \nthat this act is a pre-cannibal ritual.  \nFrom that day on, Ji-han starts doing anything to live...\n\nAmazon in crisis full of handsome cannibals! Can Jihan really survive?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/save_M2/), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/save_me)",
